#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:177
msgid "To the customer, right after ordering – with payment details (amount, IBAN, payment reference, deadline)."
msgstr "An den Kunden, direkt nach dem Bestellen – mit Zahlungsdaten (Betrag, IBAN, Zahlungsreferenz, Frist)."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:178
msgid "Internal notice for every new order – to the shop owner and/or the recipients selected below."
msgstr "Interne Info bei jeder neuen Bestellung – an den Shop-Betreiber und/oder die unten gewählten Empfänger."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:179
msgid "To the customer when a prepayment order hasn't been paid yet – sent with the “Send payment reminder” button in the order. Includes the payment details."
msgstr "An den Kunden, wenn eine Vorkasse-Bestellung noch nicht bezahlt ist – per Knopf „Zahlungserinnerung senden“ in der Bestellung. Mit den Zahlungsdaten."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:180
msgid "To the customer when an order shipped on invoice hasn't been paid after the payment due date – sent with the “Send payment reminder” button in the order. Without a cancellation warning (the goods are already with the customer)."
msgstr "An den Kunden, wenn eine auf Rechnung versendete Bestellung nach dem Zahlungsziel noch nicht bezahlt ist – per Knopf „Zahlungserinnerung senden“ in der Bestellung. Ohne Storno-Androhung (die Ware ist schon beim Kunden)."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:181
msgid "To the customer as soon as an order is marked as “paid” in the backend."
msgstr "An den Kunden, sobald eine Bestellung im Backend als „bezahlt“ markiert wird."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:182
msgid "As soon as a prepayment order is paid: one email per warehouse with its products as an order to ship/set aside – to the recipients selected below."
msgstr "Sobald eine Vorkasse-Bestellung bezahlt ist: je Lager eine Mail mit dessen Artikeln als Auftrag zum Versenden/Bereitlegen – an die unten gewählten Empfänger."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:183
msgid "Immediately for an order on invoice or with cash on pickup (without waiting for payment): one email per warehouse with its products as an order to ship/set aside. Recipients are set as for the “Shipping order to warehouse”."
msgstr "Sofort bei einer Bestellung auf Rechnung oder mit Barzahlung bei Abholung (ohne auf die Zahlung zu warten): je Lager eine Mail mit dessen Artikeln als Auftrag zum Versenden/Zurücklegen. Empfänger wie beim „Versandauftrag ans Lager“."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:184
msgid "To the customer as soon as the order is marked as “shipped” or “picked up”."
msgstr "An den Kunden, sobald die Bestellung als „versendet“ bzw. „abgeholt“ markiert wird."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:185
msgid "To the customer of a pickup order when you click “Ready for pickup” in the order – with what is ready and where to collect it (address of the warehouse)."
msgstr "An den Kunden einer Abhol-Bestellung, wenn du in der Bestellung auf „Abholbereit“ klickst – mit dem, was bereitliegt, und wo er es abholt (Adresse des Lagers)."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:186
msgid "To the customer as soon as an invoice or credit note is created (Settings → Invoices) – with the PDF attached and a download link."
msgstr "An den Kunden, sobald eine Rechnung oder Gutschrift erstellt wird (Einstellungen → Rechnungen) – mit dem PDF im Anhang und einem Download-Link."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:187
msgid "To the customer when the whole order is cancelled – with a note about the refund."
msgstr "An den Kunden, wenn die ganze Bestellung storniert wird – mit Hinweis zur Rückzahlung."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:188
msgid "To the customer when individual products are cancelled (e.g. not deliverable) – with the new amount or refund."
msgstr "An den Kunden, wenn einzelne Artikel storniert werden (z. B. nicht lieferbar) – mit neuem Betrag bzw. Rückzahlung."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:189
msgid "To the customer when returned goods are recorded as a return in the backend – with the refund or new invoice amount."
msgstr "An den Kunden, wenn zurückgeschickte Ware im Backend als Retoure erfasst wird – mit Rückzahlung bzw. neuem Rechnungsbetrag."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:190
msgid "Internal notice for every cancellation (whole order or individual products) – e.g. to the cashier so a refund gets handled."
msgstr "Interne Info bei jeder Stornierung (ganz oder einzelne Artikel) – z. B. an die Kassa, damit eine Rückzahlung erledigt wird."

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:254
msgid "Your order {{order_number}} at {{shop_name}}"
msgstr "Deine Bestellung {{order_number}} bei {{shop_name}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:255
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>thank you for your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong>!</p><h3>Your products</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>Goods value: {{goods_total}} €{{discount_line}}<br>Shipping: {{shipping_cost}} €<br><strong>Total: {{total}} €</strong></p><h3>Payment: {{payment_method_label}}</h3><p>{{payment_details}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>vielen Dank für deine Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong>!</p><h3>Deine Artikel</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>Warenwert: {{goods_total}} €{{discount_line}}<br>Versand: {{shipping_cost}} €<br><strong>Gesamtsumme: {{total}} €</strong></p><h3>Zahlung: {{payment_method_label}}</h3><p>{{payment_details}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:261
msgid "New order {{order_number}} at {{shop_name}}"
msgstr "Neue Bestellung {{order_number}} bei {{shop_name}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:262
msgid "<p>A new order has come in.</p><p><strong>Order number:</strong> {{order_number}}<br><strong>Payment reference:</strong> {{payment_reference}}<br><strong>Customer:</strong> {{customer_name}} ({{customer_email}}, phone: {{customer_phone}})</p><h3>Products</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>Goods value: {{goods_total}} €{{discount_line}}<br>Shipping: {{shipping_cost}} €<br><strong>Total: {{total}} €</strong><br>Payment method: {{payment_method_label}}</p><p>{{delivery_info}}</p><p>Invoice to: {{billing_info}}</p><p>View orders: {{orders_url}}</p>"
msgstr "<p>Es ist eine neue Bestellung eingegangen.</p><p><strong>Bestellnummer:</strong> {{order_number}}<br><strong>Zahlungsreferenz:</strong> {{payment_reference}}<br><strong>Kunde:</strong> {{customer_name}} ({{customer_email}}, Tel.: {{customer_phone}})</p><h3>Artikel</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>Warenwert: {{goods_total}} €{{discount_line}}<br>Versand: {{shipping_cost}} €<br><strong>Gesamtsumme: {{total}} €</strong><br>Zahlungsart: {{payment_method_label}}</p><p>{{delivery_info}}</p><p>Rechnung an: {{billing_info}}</p><p>Bestellungen ansehen: {{orders_url}}</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:268
msgid "Payment received: order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "Zahlung erhalten: Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:269
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>we have received your payment of <strong>{{total}} €</strong> for order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> – thank you!</p><p>{{next_step}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>deine Zahlung über <strong>{{total}} €</strong> für die Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> ist bei uns eingegangen – vielen Dank!</p><p>{{next_step}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:275
msgid "Reminder: order {{order_number}} is still open"
msgstr "Erinnerung: Bestellung {{order_number}} ist noch offen"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:276
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> is reserved for you, but we haven’t seen a payment yet. If you’ve already made the transfer, all good – the payment is probably on its way.</p><h3>Your products</h3><p>{{items}}</p><h3>Payment</h3><p>{{payment_details}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>deine Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> ist bei uns reserviert, aber wir haben noch keinen Zahlungseingang gesehen. Falls du schon überwiesen hast, ist alles gut – die Zahlung ist dann vermutlich unterwegs.</p><h3>Deine Artikel</h3><p>{{items}}</p><h3>Zahlung</h3><p>{{payment_details}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Bei Fragen antworte einfach auf diese Mail.</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:282
msgid "Payment reminder: invoice for order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "Zahlungserinnerung: Rechnung zu Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:283
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>we hope your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> arrived safely. The invoice of <strong>{{total}} €</strong> was due on {{payment_due_date}} – we haven’t seen a payment so far. If you’ve already made the transfer, all good – the payment is probably on its way.</p><h3>Payment</h3><p>{{payment_details}}</p><h3>Your products</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>wir hoffen, deine Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> ist gut bei dir angekommen. Die Rechnung über <strong>{{total}} €</strong> war am {{payment_due_date}} fällig – einen Zahlungseingang haben wir bisher nicht gesehen. Falls du schon überwiesen hast, ist alles gut – die Zahlung ist dann vermutlich unterwegs.</p><h3>Zahlung</h3><p>{{payment_details}}</p><h3>Deine Artikel</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Bei Fragen antworte einfach auf diese Mail.</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:289
msgid "Payment confirmed: order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "Zahlungseingang bestätigt: Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:290
msgid "<p>Hi {{warehouse_manager_name}},</p><p>payment for order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> is confirmed. Please prepare it for shipping/pickup:</p><h3>Products</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{delivery_info}}</p><p>{{shop_name}}</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{warehouse_manager_name}},</p><p>für Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> ist der Zahlungseingang bestätigt. Bitte für Versand/Abholung vorbereiten:</p><h3>Artikel</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{delivery_info}}</p><p>{{shop_name}}</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:296
msgid "Shipping request (pay later): order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "Versandauftrag (später bezahlt): Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:297
msgid "<p>Hi {{warehouse_manager_name}},</p><p>order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> is paid later (on invoice or in cash on pickup) – please prepare it right away without waiting for payment:</p><h3>Products</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{delivery_info}}</p><p>{{shop_name}}</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{warehouse_manager_name}},</p><p>Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> wird später bezahlt (auf Rechnung oder bar bei Abholung) – bitte gleich vorbereiten, ohne auf die Zahlung zu warten:</p><h3>Artikel</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{delivery_info}}</p><p>{{shop_name}}</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:303
msgid "Your order {{order_number}} is on its way"
msgstr "Deine Bestellung {{order_number}} ist unterwegs"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:304
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>good news about your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong>: {{shipping_note}}</p><h3>In this package</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{tracking_info}}</p><p>{{remaining_note}}</p><p>{{payment_note}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>gute Nachrichten zu deiner Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong>: {{shipping_note}}</p><h3>In diesem Paket</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{tracking_info}}</p><p>{{remaining_note}}</p><p>{{payment_note}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:310
msgid "Your order {{order_number}} is ready for pickup"
msgstr "Deine Bestellung {{order_number}} ist abholbereit"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:311
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> is ready for pickup.</p><h3>Ready for you</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{pickup_info}}</p><p>{{payment_note}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>deine Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> ist abholbereit.</p><h3>Für dich bereit</h3><p>{{items}}</p><p>{{pickup_info}}</p><p>{{payment_note}}</p><p>Deinen Bestellstatus siehst du jederzeit hier: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:317
msgid "{{document_title}} {{invoice_number}} for your order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "{{document_title}} {{invoice_number}} zu deiner Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:318
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>attached is the {{document_title}} <strong>{{invoice_number}}</strong> for your order {{order_number}} ({{total}} €).</p><p>You can also download it here: {{invoice_url}}</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>anbei die {{document_title}} <strong>{{invoice_number}}</strong> zu deiner Bestellung {{order_number}} ({{total}} €).</p><p>Du kannst sie auch hier herunterladen: {{invoice_url}}</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:324
msgid "Your order {{order_number}} has been cancelled"
msgstr "Deine Bestellung {{order_number}} wurde storniert"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:325
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> for {{total}} € has been cancelled.</p><p>{{cancel_reason}}</p><p>{{refund_note}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>deine Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> über {{total}} € wurde storniert.</p><p>{{cancel_reason}}</p><p>{{refund_note}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Bei Fragen antworte einfach auf diese Mail.</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:331
msgid "Change to your order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "Änderung deiner Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:332
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>unfortunately we can’t deliver the following products from your order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> – they have been cancelled:</p><p>{{cancelled_items}}</p><p>{{cancel_reason}}</p><p>{{amount_note}}</p><p>The rest of your order remains unchanged. If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>leider können wir aus deiner Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> folgende Artikel nicht liefern – sie wurden storniert:</p><p>{{cancelled_items}}</p><p>{{cancel_reason}}</p><p>{{amount_note}}</p><p>Der Rest deiner Bestellung bleibt unverändert. Bei Fragen antworte einfach auf diese Mail.</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:338
msgid "Return for your order {{order_number}} has arrived"
msgstr "Retoure zu deiner Bestellung {{order_number}} ist angekommen"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:339
msgid "<p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>your return for order <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> has arrived:</p><p>{{returned_items}}</p><p>{{return_reason}}</p><p>{{amount_note}}</p><p>View your order status anytime: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>If you have any questions, just reply to this email.</p><p>Best regards<br>your {{shop_name}} team</p>"
msgstr "<p>Hallo {{customer_name}},</p><p>deine Rücksendung zur Bestellung <strong>{{order_number}}</strong> ist bei uns angekommen:</p><p>{{returned_items}}</p><p>{{return_reason}}</p><p>{{amount_note}}</p><p>Status deiner Bestellung jederzeit ansehen: {{order_status_url}}</p><p>Bei Fragen antworte einfach auf diese Mail.</p><p>Liebe Grüsse<br>dein {{shop_name}}-Team</p>"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:345
msgid "Cancellation on order {{order_number}}"
msgstr "Storno bei Bestellung {{order_number}}"

#: src/Domain/Notifications/DefaultTemplates.php:346
msgid "<p><strong>{{cancel_scope}}</strong></p><p><strong>Order:</strong> {{order_number}}<br><strong>Customer:</strong> {{customer_name}} ({{customer_email}})</p><h3>Cancelled products</h3><p>{{cancelled_items}}</p><p><strong>Reason:</strong> {{cancel_reason}}</p><p><strong>{{amount_note}}</strong></p><p>View order: {{order_url}}</p>"
msgstr "<p><strong>{{cancel_scope}}</strong></p><p><strong>Bestellung:</strong> {{order_number}}<br><strong>Kunde:</strong> {{customer_name}} ({{customer_email}})</p><h3>Stornierte Artikel</h3><p>{{cancelled_items}}</p><p><strong>Grund:</strong> {{cancel_reason}}</p><p><strong>{{amount_note}}</strong></p><p>Bestellung ansehen: {{order_url}}</p>"

